Version: 1.0
desc: Lord of the Rinks Tonewheel Organ (setBfree port) by chmaha
tags: instrument
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Tonewheel organ with upper and lower manuals, pedals, percussion,
  vibrato/chorus scanner, overdrive, reverb and a rotary speaker,
  ported from setBfree by Fredrik Kilander, Robin Gareus, Ken Restivo and Will Panther
  https://github.com/pantherb/setBfree (GPLv2+)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code

